r /> <h4><span>以上是我自己实验用的。</span></h4> <hr /> <div class="info-container"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&nbsp;</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&nbsp;</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div> <p>这里是Kcorena。</p> <p>看到大家都在为MTF队标做准备，我就给我自己的MTF也画了一个，然后……人一飘就开始了。</p> <p>本质上我的风格是对阳阳的拙劣模仿，还请大家伙轻点喷。</p> <p>这个页面应该会不时更新，欢迎来查看。</p> <hr /></div> <hr /> <div id="u-author_block"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><span class="logical-link-wrap"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/kcorena-s-personnel-file">http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/kcorena-s-personnel-file</a><span class="logical-link-internal logical-link-internal-false"><span class="logical-link-title logical-link-link-true"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/kcorena-s-personnel-file">http:scp-wiki-cn-wikidot-com-kcorena-s-personnel-file</a></span><span class="logical-link-custom logical-link-link-true"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/kcorena-s-personnel-file">▸ 该作者的更多作品 ◂</a></span></span><span class="logical-link-original logical-link-original-false"><span class="logical-link-appended">（<a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/kcorena-s-personnel-file">原文链接</a>）</span><span class="logical-link-title logical-link-link-true"><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/kcorena-s-personnel-file">http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/kcorena-s-personnel-file</a></span><span class="logical-link-custom logical-link-link-true"><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/kcorena-s-personnel-file">▸ 该作者的更多作品 ◂</a></span></span><span class="logical-link-mark-common logical-link-mark-mark-false" style="color: #009966"><sup><span class="fa fa-link"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&nbsp;</span></span></sup></span