						 <div style="display:none"><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/nav%3Aside/styleFrame.html?bhl" name="typeFrame"></iframe></div> <div class="creditRate"> <div class="rateBox"> <div class="rate-box-with-credit-button"> <div class="creditButton"> <p><a class="fa fa-info" href="#u-credit-view"></a></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="clear:both;"></div> <div id="u-credit-view"> <div class="fader"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/1" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="" style=""></iframe></p> </div> <div class="modalcontainer"> <div class="modalbox"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span>著作信息</span></h2> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit first"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/4" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="close-credits" style="height:2em;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> <p><br /> <strong>SCP-CN-1485</strong>-将尔晦明，彼凭一叩</p> <p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sciencekiller" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5480202&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609145892" alt="sciencekiller" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5480202)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sciencekiller" >sciencekiller</a></span></p> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/sciencekiller">如果你想了解该作者的更多作品，请点击此处</a></p> <hr /> <p><strong>鸣谢：</strong> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/simon-arran" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4354147&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609145892" alt="Simon Arran" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4354147)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/simon-arran" >Simon Arran</a></span><span class="