&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;写作心得：&lt;strong&gt;把自己当成一只鸽子，永远不要以为自己能写出一个续集。&lt;/strong&gt;每当你写完一个故事/SCP，看看它能否独立于将来的部分。就如&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/qntm&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=571081&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609145896&quot; alt=&quot;qntm&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=571081)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/qntm&quot;  &gt;qntm&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;所述，在关键的地方吊胃口写个“未完待续”并不能起到预想中的效果。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;——&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/timeelapsed&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3662783&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609145896&quot; alt=&quot;TimeElapsed&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3662783)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/timeelapsed&quot;  &gt;TimeElapsed&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/timeelapsed&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3662783&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609145896&quot; alt=&quot;TimeElapsed&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3662783)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/timeelapsed&quot;  &gt;TimeElapsed&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
